{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39052","headline":"春草碧色 · 王毂","name":"春草碧色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"习习东风扇，萋萋草色新。\n浅深千里碧，高下一时春。\n嫩叶舒烟际，微香动水滨。\n金塘明夕照，辇路惹芳尘。\n造化功何广，阳和力自均。\n今当发生日，沥恳祝良辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王毂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39052.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39052","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}